// Battle Cry = a triggered ability [CR#702.91a]: "Whenever this creature
// attacks, each other attacking creature gets +1/+0 until end of turn." The
// trigger fires when THIS creature becomes an attacker
// (`AttackDeclared(by: Ref(This))`, the [CR#508.1k]/
// [CR#603.2e] declare-attackers onset) — no intervening-if (it always
// resolves; "each other attacking creature" is the affected set, not a gate).
//
// "each other attacking creature" = every attacking creature that ISN'T this
// one: an anthem-shaped `Each(SelectAll(...))` distribution over
// `AllOf([Type(Creature), Attacking, Not(Ref(This))])` ([CR#509.1a]
// still-in-combat attackers minus the carrier). The boost is +1/+0
// (`Power(Up(1))`, no toughness change), lasting until end of turn
// ([CR#611.2a]).
//
// NOTE [CR#702.91b]: multiple instances of battle cry trigger separately —
// that is the engine's per-instance trigger handling, not anything this
// single-instance body encodes.
KeywordAbility(
    name: "BattleCry",
    template: "battle cry",
    abilities: [Triggered(
        event: AttackDeclared(by: Ref(This)),
        effect: Continuously(
            effect: Each(SelectAll(AllOf([Type(Creature), Attacking, Not(Ref(This))])), Modify(It, Power(Up(1)))),
            duration: FixedUntil(EndOfTurn),
        ),
    )],
)
